  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omusajja wa Katonda Ava mu Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusajja wa Katonda n'ajja e Beseri okuva mu Yuda olw'ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", n'asanga Yerobowaamu ng'ayimiridde mu maaso g'ekyoto ng'ateekateeka okwotereza obubaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ayogerera mu ddoboozi ery'omwanguka eri ekyoto olw'ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'agamba nti, \"Ayi ekyoto, ekyoto! Kino",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ky'agamba nti, 'Omwana erinnya lye Yosiya alizaalibwa mu nnyumba ya Dawudi, ku ggwe kw'aliweerayo bakabona ab'ebifo ebigulumivu ng'ebiweebwayo era n'amagumba g'abantu galyokerwa ku ggwe.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo omusajja wa Katonda n'awa akabonero: \"Kano ke kabonero",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kalangirira. Ekyoto kiryatika n'evvu lyakyo liriyiyibwa ebweru.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo kabaka Yerobowaamu bwe yawulira omusajja wa Katonda bye yayogera, n'ayogera n'eddoboozi eddene ku kyoto e Beseri ng'awanise omukono gwe mu maaso g'ekyoto nti, \"Mumukwate!\" Omukono gwe yawanika eri omusajja wa Katonda ne gukala ne gukalambalirayo n'okuyinza n'atayinza kuguzza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ekyoto ne kyatikamu, n'evvu ne liyiika ng'akabonero omusajja wa Katonda ke yawa olw'ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Kabaka n'agamba omusajja wa Katonda nti, \"Negayiririra",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo, onsabire omukono gwange guwonyezebwe.\" Omusajja wa Katonda n'amwegayiririra eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", omukono gwe ne guddawo nga bwe gwali olubereberye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka n'agamba omusajja wa Katonda nti, \"Jjangu eka ewange obeeko ky'olya, n'okukuwa nkuweeyo ekirabo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omusajja wa Katonda n'agamba kabaka nti, \"Ne bw'onompa ekitundu ky'obugagga bwo, sijja kugenda naawe, wadde okulya omugaati oba okunywa amazzi wano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubanga nkuutiddwa ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti, 'Tolya mugaati newaakubadde okunywa amazzi wadde okuddira mu kkubo ly'ojjiddemu.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo n'addirayo mu kkubo eddala, so si mu eryo lye yajjiramu e Beseri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo mu biro ebyo waaliwo nnabbi omukadde eyabeeranga mu Beseri, eyategeezebwa batabani be ebyo byonna omusajja wa Katonda bye yali akoze ku lunaku olwo, ne bye yali agambye kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitaabwe n'ababuuza nti, \"Akutte kkubo ki?\" Awo batabani be ne bamulaga ekkubo omusajja wa Katonda ow'e Yuda ly'akutte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo n'agamba batabani be nti, \"Munteekereteekere endogoyi.\" Bwe baamala okumutegekera endogoyi, n'agyebagala,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'akwata ekkubo omusajja wa Katonda lye yali akutte. Yamusanga atudde wansi w'omwera, n'amubuuza nti, \"Gwe musajja wa Katonda eyavudde e Yuda?\" N'addamu nti, \"Nze nzuuno.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo nnabbi n'amugamba nti, \"Tuddeyo eka olye ku mmere.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusajja wa Katonda n'amuddamu nti, \"Siyinza kuddayo newaakubadde okugenda naawe, wadde okulya omugaati oba okunywa amazzi naawe mu kifo kino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndagiddwa ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti, 'Toteekwa kulyayo ku mmere newaakubadde okunywayo amazzi, wadde okuddirayo mu kkubo lye wajjiddemu.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo nnabbi omukadde n'amuddamu nti, \"Nze nange ndi nnabbi nga ggwe. Era malayika yaŋŋambye ekigambo kya Katonda nti, 'Mukomyewo mu nnyumba yo alye ku mmere anywe ne ku mazzi.' \" Naye yali amulimba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo omusajja wa Katonda n'addayo naye mu nnyumba ye n'alya era n'anywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali batudde nga balya, ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kijjira nnabbi omukadde eyali amukomezzaawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ayogerera mu ddoboozi ery'omwanguka eri omusajja wa Katonda eyava mu Yuda nti, \"Bw'ati bw'ayogera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti, 'Ojeemedde ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era tokuumye kiragiro",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda kye yakulagidde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakomyewo n'olya emmere era n'onywa amazzi mu kifo kye yakugaanye okulyamu wadde okunywamu amazzi. Noolwekyo omulambo gwo teguliziikibwa mu ntaana ya bajjajjaabo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusajja wa Katonda bwe yamala okulya n'okunywa, nnabbi oli eyali amukomezzaawo, n'ategeka endogoyi y'omusajja wa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo bwe yali ng'ali ku lugendo lwe, empologoma n'emusangiriza n'emutta, era n'esuula omulambo gwe ku kkubo, empologoma n'endogoyi ne biyimirira okumpi nagwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laba, abantu abamu abaalaba omulambo nga gusuuliddwa wansi, nga n'empologoma eyimiridde kumpi nagwo, ne bagenda mu kibuga nnabbi mwe yabeeranga ne bategeeza abaayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnabbi eyali amukomezzaawo bwe yakiwulira n'ayogera nti, \"Ye musajja wa Katonda ataagondedde kigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amuwaddeyo eri empologoma emutaagudde n'emutta, ng'ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwe ky'amulabudde.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo nnabbi n'agamba batabani be nti, \"Muntegekere endogoyi.\" Ne bagimutegekera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nagenda n'asanga omulambo gw'omusajja wa Katonda nga gusuuliddwa mu kkubo n'endogoyi n'empologoma nga ziyimiridde kumpi nagwo; empologoma nga teridde mulambo so nga tetaaguddetaagudde ndogoyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnabbi n'asitula omulambo gw'omusajja wa Katonda n'aguteeka ku ndogoyi, era n'aguzzaayo mu kibuga kye n'amukungubagira, omulambo n'aguziika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ateeka omulambo gwe mu ntaana ye ye, ne bamukungubagira nga bakaaba nti, \"Woowe, muganda wange!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo bwe baamala okumuziika, n'agamba batabani be nti, \"Bwe nfanga, munziikanga mu ntaana omusajja wa Katonda mw'aziikiddwa; muteekanga amagumba gange kumpi n'amagumba ge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.13.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", omusajja wa Katonda kye yayogera n'eddoboozi ery'omwanguka ku kyoto ekiri mu Beseri ne ku masabo ag'ebifo ebigulumivu ebiri mu bibuga eby'e Samaliya, tekirirema kutuukirira.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluvannyuma lw'ekigambo ekyo Yerobowaamu n'atakyuka kuleka amakubo ge amabi, naye ne yeeyongera nate okussaawo bakabona ab'ebifo ebigulumivu ng'abaggya mu bantu abaabulijjo. Buli eyayagalanga okubeera kabona, n'amwawulanga okubeera mu bifo ebigulumivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kino kye kyali ekibi ky'ennyumba ya Yerobowaamu ekyagireetera okugwa, okugimalawo n'okugizikiriza okuva ku nsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
